@startuml
title EventFlow — C4 Level 1: System Context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Customer" as Customer
actor "Event Organizer" as Organizer
actor "Customer Support" as Support
actor "Platform Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "EventFlow" as EventFlow #E8F1FA {
  rectangle "Online Ticket Booking\nand Event Platform" as System #B8D5F2
}

rectangle "External Payment Provider" as Payment #FFF0D9
rectangle "OIDC Identity Provider" as IdP #FFF0D9
rectangle "Email / Notification Provider" as Email #FFF0D9

Customer --> System : Browse events,\nselect seats, book and pay\nHTTPS/JSON
Organizer --> System : Manage events and\n ticket inventory\nHTTPS/JSON
Support --> System : Support and order lookup\nHTTPS/JSON
Admin --> System : Platform administration\nHTTPS/JSON

System --> Payment : Payment requests\nHTTPS/JSON
Payment --> System : Payment callbacks\nHTTPS/JSON
System --> IdP : Authentication flow\nOIDC / OAuth 2.0 over HTTPS
System --> Email : Deliver notifications\nHTTPS/JSON

note bottom of System
  Scope:
  Event catalogue, venue seating,
  reservations, payments, ticket issuance,
  access control and anti-scalping.
end note
@enduml
